# Aero Dynamic Window — Environment Setup
#
# This repository holds two separate applications:
#   - aero-1/ : Cesium + Threlte (production kiosk). Configure aero-1/.env (see aero-1/.env.example)
#   - aero-2/ : MapLibre GL + Three rewrite. Configure aero-2/.env (see aero-2/.env.example)
#
# The repository root has no package.json or dev server.
# Please copy the appropriate .env.example inside aero-1/ or aero-2/ to .env.
